### Pruebas rápidas desde Visual Studio / VS Code (extensión REST Client)
### 1) Ejecuta "login", copia el token y pégalo en @token.

@host = http://localhost:5080
@token = PEGA_AQUI_EL_TOKEN

### Salud / conexión a Supabase
GET {{host}}/api/health

### 🔐 Login
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "Admin123*"
}

### Usuario actual
GET {{host}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 📦 Productos (con búsqueda opcional)
GET {{host}}/api/products?search=cha
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Stock (solo stock bajo)
GET {{host}}/api/inventory/stock?lowStockOnly=true
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Kardex filtrado
GET {{host}}/api/inventory/kardex?type=OUTBOUND&from=2026-01-01&to=2026-12-31
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 🛒 Pedido con cliente NUEVO
POST {{host}}/api/orders/with-customer
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "newCustomer": {
    "customerName": "Bodega San Martín",
    "contactName": "Rosa Quispe",
    "address": "Av. La Cultura 123",
    "city": "Cusco",
    "postalCode": "08000",
    "country": "Peru"
  },
  "shipperId": 1,
  "items": [
    { "productId": 1, "quantity": 5 },
    { "productId": 2, "quantity": 3 }
  ]
}

### 🛒 Pedido con cliente EXISTENTE
POST {{host}}/api/orders/with-customer
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": 1,
  "shipperId": 2,
  "items": [ { "productId": 3, "quantity": 2 } ]
}

### Historial de un cliente
GET {{host}}/api/orders/customer/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Todos los pedidos (vista)
GET {{host}}/api/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Eliminar pedido
DELETE {{host}}/api/orders/10443
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 👥 Actualizar dirección de cliente
PUT {{host}}/api/customers/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "address": "Jr. Nuevo 456",
  "city": "Lima"
}

### 📥 Nueva orden de compra
POST {{host}}/api/purchase-orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "supplierId": 1,
  "requiredDate": "2026-12-15",
  "items": [
    { "productId": 1, "quantity": 50, "unitPrice": 12.5 }
  ]
}

### Recibir orden de compra (suma stock + INBOUND)
PUT {{host}}/api/purchase-orders/1/receive
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 📊 KPIs
GET {{host}}/api/dashboard/kpis
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Ventas vs inversión por mes
GET {{host}}/api/dashboard/sales-vs-investment
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
